# Kept out of the archive Composer installs (--prefer-dist): what only builds
# and publishes the semitexa/installer image, and the tool that derives the
# manifest in the framework workspace. A project that has this package in
# vendor/ reads scaffold/ and resources/scaffold-manifest.json through src/, nothing else.
#
# scaffold/ is NOT here, and neither is scaffold/Dockerfile: that one is the
# project's own Dockerfile. The line below names the image's, at the root.
/Dockerfile export-ignore
/entrypoint.sh export-ignore
/commands export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/tools export-ignore
# The tests compare this package with the semitexa-update checkout beside it
# (tests/Unit/ScaffoldManifestTest.php): they belong to a git checkout, where
# the workspace and the release clone run them. An archive in vendor/ has no
# such neighbour on the same line.
/tests export-ignore
